The term of office of a judge ceases
if he/she so requests;
Clause 1 of this amendment replaces paragraph 3 of Article 99 of the Constitution of the Republic of Macedonia.

The Judicial Council of the Republic of Macedonia
elects and dismisses judges and lay judges;
This amendment replaces Article 105 of the Constitution of the Republic of Macedonia and deletes line 15 of paragraph 1, Article 68 of the Constitution of the Republic of Macedonia.
